WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:03.890
Hide inside the shuttle!

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:09.260
We're sealed in!

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.180
It's a trap!

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:23.890
Yusei Fudo, you'll vanish into 
the crevice between dimensions.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.220
What is this?  What's going on?

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.720
Big trouble!

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:48.290
They're about to send this 
shuttle into a wormhole!

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.050
Wormhole?

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:52.000
It's a tunnel that connects 
to another dimension!

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.990
If we enter, I don't know where we'll end up.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:56.900
You!

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:01.740
So it's Yusei Fudo, Sherry 
LeBlanc and a friend.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:03.740
How do you know my name?

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:07.060
He knew who we were from the beginning.

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:10.100
You fell into my trap.

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:14.870
Your actions prove there's a connection 
between your company and Iliaster.

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:17.610
You know who killed my father!

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:21.560
Dr. LeBlanc?  I haven't heard 
that name in a long time.

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:27.630
He was an excellent man, but 
he asked too many questions.

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:29.030
Too many questions?

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:34.140
Dr. LeBlanc created Infinity's control card.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:38.730
But he found out how we were 
going to use this device.

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.300
How to use this device?

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:45.060
Infinity is a device that 
connects various eras.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:49.510
Iliaster was using Infinity to alter history.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.500
Alter history?

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:54.710
The world must never find out.  It's taboo.

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:57.610
But Dr. LeBlanc discovered the truth.

00:01:57.610 --> 00:01:59.200
That's why we got rid of him.

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:00.650
I'll never forgive you!

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:04.390
In your current situation, 
your threats don't scare me.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:09.630
Besides, now that you know the 
truth, I can't let you go free.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:10.950
How dare you!

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:13.140
That shuttle doesn't have a control card.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:17.530
It will fall out of the wormhole and be 
lost among the dimensional distortions.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:20.430
Farewell, Yusei Fudo and Sherry LeBlanc.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:21.280
Wait!

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:39.300
Riding Duels.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:42.350
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:49.220
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:10.540
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:20.650
Soar in the infinite skies  BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:26.880
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:32.860
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:38.630
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:44.240
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:50.640
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:56.410
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:03:56.650 --> 00:04:02.720
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:09.060
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:38.690
The Distorted Past

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:58.710
Wake up!

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.330
Are you okay?

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:04.300
Where are we?

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:09.010
We're inside the wormhole.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:12.110
It really exists?

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:17.840
Iliaster has scientific knowledge 
that exceeds our imaginations.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:19.990
What is it?

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.880
The shuttle is out-of-control.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:28.460
Please use the control card immediately.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:33.270
If we don't do something soon, the 
shuttle will fall out of the wormhole!

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:35.530
What happens if we fall out?

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:36.470
I don't know.

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:41.170
We may end up in an unknown era or shatter 
to bits in a dimensional distortion.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:43.160
It's no good!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.800
Bruno, how is it over there?

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:48.010
It's no good!  The controls don't work!

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.930
This is bad.  At this rate…

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.340
Can't we do anything?

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:02.410
If we don't have the control 
card, there's nothing we can do.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.180
Control card?

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:07.840
What's that?

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.980
My father left me this card.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.310
Will it work?

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:18.010
Card confirmed.  Starting control program.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:19.490
It's moving!

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:22.990
Confirming course.  Altering 
shuttle trajectory.

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:35.960
Sherry!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.770
Yusei!

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:54.440
Yusei, get my revenge!

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:56.650
You have to do that yourself!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.860
Sherry!

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:05.660
Sherry!

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.990
Closing emergency shutters.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.430
Sherry!

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:23.220
Sherry!

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:42.660
What's that?

00:07:58.770 --> 00:07:59.580
Yusei.

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:01.570
Father…

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:05.020
Yusei, you can't let that approach.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:08.990
What do you mean?  The thing 
that looks like an island?

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:13.010
That's the final Moment that will 
lead mankind to destruction.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.150
Lead to destruction?

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:17.010
Father, what do you mean?

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:20.890
Yusei, return to your world.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:26.580
Yusei, the shuttle controls are working!

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.540
We can return home!

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:32.880
I never told you to kill Yusei Fudo.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.620
But he knows Iliaster's secrets.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:40.130
He still has a vital role to play.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:42.610
What do you want with him?

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:47.300
Well, it's fine.  Yusei isn't dead.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:55.100
But now that he discovered your 
location, we can't leave it as is.

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:58.160
You'll have to vanish.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.380
What?

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:03.290
From where should we start 
destroying Moment Express?

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.660
Please wait!

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.800
I've already taken care of it.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.200
It's time for you to vanish.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:17.420
Placido!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:30.800
The mark...

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:42.950
What was that?

00:09:58.550 --> 00:09:59.470
Placido!

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:02.700
You were beaten badly, 
but you're already back.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:05.310
I won't die until I kill Yusei Fudo.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.060
That was...

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.820
It's that phenomenon again.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.200
Is something wrong?

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:18.430
You didn't notice that shockwave?

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.550
Shockwave?

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:21.970
It's nothing.  Thank you.

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:26.750
We're the only ones who 
noticed that phenomenon.

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:29.870
What happened this time?

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:32.680
Something must have changed in the past.

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.990
Someone stole our fame.

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:40.360
If we're the only ones 
who weren't affected...

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:44.790
It seems the three Aesir 
cards are protecting us.

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:55.300
Why are we coming here?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.630
I don't know, but the 
mark is leading us here.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.340
What's that?

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:03.980
Something is coming out.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.010
It's coming this way!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:13.470
That's…

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.310
Yusei!  Bruno!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.220
Everyone!

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:24.780
That means we're in Neo Domino City.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.630
We made it back home!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:28.810
Yeah.

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:32.570
Father, I've returned to this world.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:38.340
The mark started to glow so 
that it could lead us to Yusei.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.010
No, that's not the only reason.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.750
What's that?

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.670
I saw that in another dimension.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.560
You see something?

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.690
I don't see anything.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.190
Look closely!  There's a 
giant island in the sky!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:59.290
A giant island floating in the sky?

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.320
You don't see it?

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:02.860
I get it.

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:05.800
The Crimson Dragon's power 
is showing it to us.

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:09.810
Sheesh, why can't I have a mark?

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.630
What is that?

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.410
The final Moment that leads to destruction.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:16.340
What do you mean, Yusei?

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:19.780
That's what I heard.

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:24.260
Yusei, you can't let that approach.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:29.080
It will threaten us.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.410
It vanished.

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:52.990
What's going on?

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:56.220
By the way, why are you here, Yusei?

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:58.610
Didn't you go to Moment Express?

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:03.360
It's a long story.  Let's go 
back to Moment Express for now.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:04.590
Did you learn something?

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:10.070
Just like we thought, Iliaster 
controls Moment Express.

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.060
Whoa!

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:16.040
That place is the only proof 
of Iliaster's existence.

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:26.080
No way!  It's all gone!

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:27.740
Is this really the place?

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:28.990
There's no mistake!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:33.500
But how can a large facility 
vanish in an instant?

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:40.630
No...

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:41.810
She's...

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:44.030
I don't know what to say.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.650
Sherry may not be dead.

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:50.100
Yusei…

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:54.210
Yusei, there's something crazy going on!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:57.970
Look at that.

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:00.020
Look!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:06.450
Team New World, the team expected to win 
the WRGP, just arrived at the airport!

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.550
They're from Iliaster.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:14.730
Team New World?  I didn't 
know that team existed.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:17.000
What's going on?

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.810
Why is this happening?

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:26.170
Since their inception, Team New World has 
conquered tournaments around the world.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.490
They're one of the top duelist teams.

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:33.260
Their popularity and skills 
are among the world's elite.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:36.630
This article is on every website.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.620
That's weird.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:42.960
The memories of everyone in the 
world are different than ours.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.630
What's going on?

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:48.310
Bring up the brackets.

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.150
Okay.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:53.560
Look!  The tournament is different!

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:55.040
What?

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:01.050
Sherry's team is gone.

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:03.480
They've changed history.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.070
Changed history?

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:09.210
Clark and the three Iliasters 
were telling the truth.

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:12.950
They manipulated the past 
to change the present.

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.190
There's no way they could do that!

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:17.110
Then that shockwave was…

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:20.950
Since the past changed, 
there was a distortion.

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.500
I get it.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:26.370
The Crimson Dragon's power 
protected us from the effect.

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:32.970
If the past changed, that explains 
why Moment Express vanished.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:40.280
But if Iliaster has that kind of 
power, why don't they just kill us?

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:41.620
That's true.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:45.170
If Iliaster thinks we're 
an obstacle, then the

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:49.120
quickest way is to change 
history and make us disappear.

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.220
Maybe the Crimson Dragon's 
power prevents that.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.760
There's another possibility.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:55.930
What is it?

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:59.630
We may have a role to play.

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:00.730
Role?

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:05.910
Iliaster wants us around 
because it helps them?

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:09.210
We'll never be their allies!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:11.140
I know that.

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:13.410
It's contradictory.

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:19.730
Just as they said, they've 
shown up to enter the WRGP.

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:24.080
We'll find the answer by battling them.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:29.780
Yusei, are you here?

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:32.940
That's Assistant Section Chief Ushio!

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:35.310
This is bad!  I have to hide!

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:37.450
Over there!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.500
Yusei, I need to talk to you.

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:42.200
What is it?

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.950
It's a bit complicated.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.220
Complicated?

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:50.680
Yeah.  The WRGP may be canceled.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:51.970
What?

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:53.150
What?

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:56.160
Why will the WRGP be canceled?

00:16:56.160 --> 00:17:01.160
After the preliminaries, there was a 
flood of complaints against the WRGP.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:07.130
The organization committee thinks it 
may be better to cancel the tournament.

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:10.860
It's understandable because 
of that huge disaster.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:15.600
I'm against the cancellation, but none 
of the higher-ups care about my opinion.

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:18.720
The Public Maintenance Department's Director

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.720
position has been vacant since 
Director Godwin disappearance.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:25.090
The Vice Director is taking a long 
break, and no one knows where he is.

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:28.760
There's no Director?

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:30.030
I see.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:33.900
Iliaster knows they can't fulfill both 
roles, so they also changed that part of history.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.300
What do you mean?

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.770
None of your business.

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:38.230
What's up with that?

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:43.210
There isn't anyone who can overturn 
the organization committee's decision.

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:48.180
If the WRGP is canceled, we'll lose 
the opportunity to battle them.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:51.050
Damn!  This is stupid!

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:53.270
You're forgetting about me!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.120
What is it?

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:03.800
I'm finally free.

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:06.010
Vice Director Yeager!

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.490
What are you doing here?

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:12.830
You're lucky that they 
didn't change my memories.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:16.240
Vice Director Yeager is 
returning from his long break!

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:18.000
Are you sure, Yeager?

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:22.300
If you show yourself again, 
you may be in danger.

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:25.940
What's the point of being the Vice 
Director if I don't come back?

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:30.190
I've decided to fight against Iliaster!

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:31.270
Yeager...

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:33.910
I don't know how helpful you'll be.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:37.090
But if you want to battle 
alongside us, go ahead.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.730
I'm returning to the Public 
Maintenance Department!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.700
Sector Chief Sagiri!  Assistant 
Sector Chief Ushio!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:44.570
Hurry up and bring the car!

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:45.970
Right!

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:47.930
Yusei Fudo...

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:50.720
Jack Atlas, Crow Hogan.

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:56.150
Though my stay was brief, I learned 
many things from you while I was here.

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:58.060
Thank you.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:02.280
I'll do whatever it takes 
to continue the WRGP!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.360
So you must win!

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:06.500
And uncover Iliaster's identity!

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:08.650
Team 5D's!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:15.260
I am Yeager, the Public Maintenance 
Department's Vice Director.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.660
Due to Public Maintenance 
Department Rule #20,

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:23.210
I will now assume the role of the Director.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:32.200
As the Director, I guarantee the city's 
safety and declare that the WRGP must continue!

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:39.540
You're leaving?

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:43.950
Yes.  I'll travel to places 
that Sherry and I visited.

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:49.430
If she's alive, then I might find a lead.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.400
We'll also do whatever we 
can to find leads on Sherry.

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:59.450
Yusei, it's unfortunate that I can't keep 
my eye on you until the end.  Good luck.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.460
Father...

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:29.750
Where am I?

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:31.840
Did I die?

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:36.820
No.  And I'm not Dr. LeBlanc.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:42.770
The longing in your heart makes 
me look like Dr. LeBlanc.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:45.460
Who are you?

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:48.430
I am the one who knows the truth.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.440
The truth?

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:53.730
If you want to know the 
truth, I will tell you.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:58.630
But knowing the truth will 
greatly change your destiny.

